— Non-Tech Default)    │ ⚙️ \"DEVELOPER MODE\" (Full Observability — Opt-In)           │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ • **Project Chat:** Clean, natural conversation feed.       │ • **Git Tree Visualizer:** Full commit DAGs \u0026 ref scrubbing.│\n│ • **Active Tasks:** Simple checklist cards with progress.   │ • **Terminal Logs:** Raw container stdout/stderr \u0026 gRPC.    │\n│ • **Review Proposed Changes:** Simple green preview box.    │ • **AST Diff Inspector:** Chunk hashes, line offsets.       │\n│ • **Apply to Website:** Single 1-click confirmation button. │ • **Token / Credit Monitor:** Per-turn billing telemetry.   │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\nThe user never manages a roster of virtual employees or configures compute tiers. They state an outcome, view verified progress in the Task DAG, inspect artifacts on the canvas, and approve changes via 1-click Pull Request cards. Cloudflare’s serverless edge engine coordinates execution invisibly beneath the surface.",
