        "text": " $lte: user.roleRank }              // 1: Viewer -\u003e 2: Member -\u003e 3: Editor"
      }, {
        "text": " -\u003e 4: Admin -\u003e 5: Owner\n  }\n});\n```\n\n### XML Semantic Boundary Envelopes\n"
      }, {
        "text": "All retrieved context chunks are wrapped in protective tags before LLM ingestion:\n$$\\mathcal{F}_{\\text{sandbox}}(c_i) \u003d"
      }, {
        "text": " \\text{\"\u003ccontext_chunk id\u003d\\\"\"} \\circ \\text{Hash}(c_i) \\circ \\"
      }, {
        "text": "text{\"\\\" access\u003d\\\"verified\\\"\u003e\"} \\circ \\text{EscapeXML}(c_i) \\circ \\text{\"\u003c/context_"
      }, {
        "text": "chunk\u003e\"}$$\n\n### Google Search AI Mode at the Edge\n1. **Sub-50ms Semantic Cache ("
      }, {
        "text": "KV):** If query embedding cosine similarity is $\u003e0.96$ against historical queries, returns the cached, verified answer"
      }, {
        "text": " in 35ms with zero LLM compute.\n2. **Dense + Sparse Hybrid RRF ($k\u003d60$"
      }, {
        "text": "):** Fuses Vectorize semantic embeddings with in-memory BM25 exact keyword matching:\n   $$\\text{"
      }, {
        "text": "Score}(d) \u003d \\sum_{m \\in \\{\\text{dense}, \\text{sparse}\\}} \\frac{1}{"
      }, {
        "text": "60 + \\text{Rank}_m(d)}$$\n3. **Interactive Numbered Citations:** Output"
      }, {
        "text": " streams with clickable citation badges (`[1] Contract §4.2`, `[2] Delaware Statute`) linking directly to source chunk"
      }, {
        "text": " coordinates in R2.\n\n### Inter-Project MCP v2 Mesh\n* Every project exposes a stateless **`https://api.avos"
      }, {
        "text": ".com/spaces/:sId/projects/:pId/mcp`** endpoint via Cloudflare MCP SDK v2 (`create"
      }, {
        "text": "McpHandler`).\n* Projects interact as microservices over Stateless Streamable HTTP without open SSE sockets.\n* Pipedream is"
      }, {
        "text": " dropped entirely; Composio serves strictly as an external SaaS OAuth broker.\n\n---\n\n## 10. Stateful Micro-Apps (\""
      }, {
        "text": "Cloudflare OS Gadgets\") \u0026 Dynamic UI\n\nAVOS implements Cloudflare\u0027s **Cloudflare OS (August "
      }, {
        "text": "2026)** architecture, dividing UI deliverables into three tiers:\n\n```\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"
