        "text": "-app gets its own isolated **DO Facet SQLite database** provisioned in milliseconds.\n* **Auto-Generated MCP"
      }, {
        "text": " v2 Server:** The runtime wraps every Gadget\u0027s SQLite schema into a native `/mcp` server, allowing agents to automate the"
