        "text": "ative In-Chat UI:** In chat streams, the AI dynamically renders interactive input widgets (Google Search AI Mode style date pickers,"
      }, {
        "text": " budget sliders) that return structured input directly into the turn.\n\n---\n\n## 11. Telephony, Voice"
      }, {
        "text": " Agents \u0026 Universal Shared State\n\n### Native Edge Voice Telephony (`@cloudflare/voice`)\nReplaces third-party brokers"
