        "text": "-trip audio latency.\n* **Security Clamp:** Public phone callers are clamped to **Tier 1 (Safe RAG only)**"
      }, {
        "text": "; file-editing tools and shell access are physically stripped.\n* **Dual-Thread Project Architecture (`kind: \"voice_agent\""
