        "text": " transcribes via Workers AI Whisper for $0 compute cost.\n\n### Universal Shared State Plane (`SpaceDO.space_calendar_events`)\nAll"
      }, {
        "text": " project kinds access a single shared state plane inside `SpaceDO` SQLite:\n* When a voice agent books a patient"
