 replacing the legacy \"Chat Sessions\" sidebar with an **Agent Roster UI** (showing active bots, status indicators, and `@mention` routing).\n* **Chunk 5 (Prompt: *\"Check on web articles and docs etc on Hermes ai bot modes architecture...\"*):**\n  * Explored Hermes\u0027s exact architecture:\n    * Giving each bot its own **`SOUL.md` identity file**, pinned model, and avatar.\n    * Multi-bot group chat deliberation (round-robin turn arbitration).\n    * Canonical 1-on-1 bot chats vs. public group chats.\n    * Bot-to-bot direct inboxes (Tier 3).\n    * Hybrid memory scoping (Private Bot Memory vs. Shared Project Vector Bank).\n* **Chunk 6 (Prompt: *\"I want the mental model of how the works like the user journey in a project for each tier to the rosters...\"*):**\n  * Outlined the user journey for the Roster UI: comparing a Solo 1-User Cockpit (streamlined 2-tier) against a Multi-User Digital Office (4-tier with roster).\n* **Chunk 7 (Prompt: *\"now instead of skills being workspace wide they are per agent... in channel which bots are users talking to...\"*):**\n  * Addressed per-agent modularity (skills, tools, crons, and MCP accounts per bot) and solved the **Split-Actor Dilemma** in public channels.\n* **Chunk 8 (Prompt: *\"So on adding connector user should select whether it\u0027s personal or shared this way if bots are in channels all personal connections are disabled...\"*):**\n  * Handled credential security when bots operate in public channels, creating the MCP-UI Privacy Bridge that forks to private Tier 4 scratchpads.\n* **Chunk 9 (Prompt: *\"can this do like grokbot computer to using tier 6 container as a visual computer... is this really going to beat grokbot...\"*):**\n  * Addressed matching Grok Bot\u0027s computer-use capabilities using Tier 6 GUI containers (Xvfb + noVNC).\n\n---\n\n### Summary Checklist of Files:\nIf you want to review or isolate the \"Bot Mode\" transition in your notes, focus on:\n1. **`304 - 309 What.txt`** *(Introduction of Grok Bot coworker model)*\n2. **`310 - Should.txt`**\n3. **`316 - 318 But.txt`**\n4. **`319 - 320 What.txt`** *(First mention of Hermes Bot Mode)*\n5. **`avos1.json` (Chunks 4 through 9)** *(Hermes architecture, `SOUL.md`, Roster UI, and Split-Actor execution)*",
