ancers. They act as **elite AI Systems Architects** who can walk into a local law firm or clinic, deliver a working system in 48 hours, and collect high upfront fees.\n2. **They graduate into Vertical SaaS Owners:** Because your platform includes the **1-Click Blueprint Exporter**, every hour of custom FDE work naturally compounds into a scalable, marketable SaaS product that generates recurring revenue.\n3. **Your Platform Captures the Compounding Margin:** You provide the serverless edge compute, Durable Objects, and database storage, collecting **60%–80% of ongoing subscriptions** while your army of partner developers handles 100% of sales, onboarding, and customer support.",
