        "text": " the automation and pings the administrator.\n\n#### 4. Unattended Background Auth Blocks (The 2:00 AM Problem"
      }, {
        "text": ")\n* **The Problem:** You configure an automation in CodeMode or Dynamic Workflows that requires connecting an Instagram account. The"
      }, {
        "text": " workflow runs at 2:00 AM on a cron. You cannot display a browser popup dialog because the user is asleep.\n* **The Solution"
