      }, {
        "text": " });\n  ```\n  If no account is specified, the router falls back to the **Project Default Connector** declared"
      }, {
        "text": " in the project settings.\n\n#### 6. Egress Data Loss Prevention (Outbound PII Scrubber)\n* **The Problem:**"
      }, {
        "text": " An agent extracts text from an internal M\u0026A contract or patient medical record, and an automation script forwards it to a public marketing channel"
      }, {
        "text": " (Twitter or Instagram).\n* **The Solution:** The **WriteGuard Egress Proxy** scans outgoing payloads sent to public consumer"
      }, {
        "text": " connectors (X/Twitter, Instagram, Discord) for regex patterns matching credit cards, social security numbers, private API keys"
      }, {
        "text": ", and patient identifiers. If detected, the transmission is blocked and flagged for human review.\n\n#### 7. Downstream Schema Drift ("
      }, {
        "text": "Self-Healing JSON Adapters)\n* **The Problem:** A SaaS provider updates their API response format, changing `res"
      }, {
        "text": ".data.media_url` to `res.data.media[0].uri`. Hardcoded scripts crash with "
