        "text": " fails, the error passes to a cheap Workers AI Isolate that repairs the mapping dynamically:\n  \u003e *\"API schema"
      }, {
        "text": " changed: mapped `res.data.media[0].uri` to required `media_url` field.\"*\n\n---"
      }, {
        "text": "\n\n# 4. The Complete Developer Experience (`ctx.connectors`)\n\nHere is how an agent or user writes an automation script in"
