        "text": " in Gmail\n    await ctx.connectors.gmail.markAsRead(msg.id);\n  }\n\n"
      }, {
        "text": "  return { ok: true, processedCount: messages.length };\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# 5."
      }, {
