        "text": "**Refining Extension Definitions**\n\nI\u0027m now zeroing in on the suggested terminology. \"Templates\" for pre-configured setups and \"Extensions\" for individual components seem promising. I\u0027m exploring how these terms fit within the broader AVOS architecture, ensuring clarity and consistency. The goal is a clean, intuitive naming system for both the large-scale \"vertical office\" setups and the atomic building blocks. This should map better to the Plandex analogy as well.\n\n\n",
