        "text": "**Clarifying Extension Structure**\n\nNow, I\u0027m solidifying the definitions. \"Templates\" are the complete, ready-to-use setups, think \"CodePilot Studio.\" \"Extensions\" are the individual components, atomic capabilities. I\u0027m focusing on the implementation details using a \"Tree-Sitter Project Indexer\" and its architectural mapping onto Cloudflare: This will involve a Dynamic Worker, a robust workflow, and a Durable Object Facet SQLite, allowing for large codebase indexing.\n\n\n",
