        "text": "**Defining Indexing Workflow**\n\nI\u0027m now detailing the indexing process itself. My recent focus is the architecture: the system performs deep or incremental scans of the workspace. The Tree-Sitter Wasm engine parses AST symbols using a Dynamic Worker isolate. The DO Facet SQLite stores the relational symbol table. An MCP v2 endpoint automatically exposes `extension_code_indexer_query` to the AI agent.\n\n\n\n",
