ow pull requests function within non-code workspaces. They\u0027re actually \"Deliverable Change Proposals,\" as opposed to code reviews. This could mean a Finance change to a spreadsheet or Legal alterations to a document, and in each case, the UI displays clear before-and-after views of the changes. I\u0027m aiming to articulate this broader perspective effectively, emphasizing that Git underpins all these changes.\n\n\n",
