      "text": "Your intuition here cuts straight through the complexity. You have defined the exact economic and architectural model that makes modern app stores (like Shopify, Apple, and Figma) work, but adapted for **AI-powered Cloudflare Edge Workspaces**.\n\n---\n\n# 1. What a \"Plugin\" Really Is: The Atomic Capability Bundle\n\nA Plugin is **not just a UI panel**. It is a self-contained **Atomic Capability Bundle** that drops into any project:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                       AVOS PLUGIN BUNDLE ARCHITECTURE                       │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 1. 📱 MCP v2 Micro-App       │ Interactive Frontend (MCP-UI) + Private      │\n│                              │ DO Facet SQLite Database for persistent state│\n├──────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 2. 🛠️ CodeMode Scripts \u0026 Tools│ Prebuilt Tier 1-6 execution scripts          │\n│                              │ (`SCRIPT.md` + `code.ts` in R2)              │\n├──────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 3. 🧠 Pre-Distilled Skills    │ Demonstration-to-Skill automation workflows  │\n├──────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 4. 📝 Domain Directives      │ Invariant instructions appended to           │\n│                              │ `systemPrompt` and `PROJECT.md`              │\n├──────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 5. 🛡️ Domain Linters         │ Sandboxed validation rules (HIPAA, Delaware) │\n└──────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### The Hierarchy of \"Bricks, Rooms, and Buildings\":\n* **The Plugin \u003d The Atomic Lego Brick** (e.g., *Stripe Invoicing Micro-App*, *Delaware M\u0026A Redline Linter*, *WhatsApp Intake Bot*).\n* **The Project Template \u003d The Furnished Room** (A pre-configured Project Kind with 2–3 specific Plugins already installed).\n* **The Space Template \u003d The Entire Turnkey Office Building** (A complete vertical firm like *\"LexPulse Legal\"* with multiple projects, pre-installed plugins, and custom models).\n\n---\n\n# 2. Sell Both: The Two-Tier Developer Marketplace\n\nDevelopers should be able to monetize at both levels depending on their skillset:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                                    THE TWO-TIER DEVELOPER MARKETPLACE                                   │\n├───────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Product Type                  │ Pricing Model                         │ Target Creator                  │\n├───────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────┤\n│ **1. Individual Plugins**     │ **$10 – $30 ONE-TIME Purchase**       │ Specialist coders who build one │\n│ *(e.g. M\u0026A Redline Tool,      │ (100% of license to plugin dev,       │ great micro-app or linter tool  │\n│  Shopify Sync Micro-App)*     │  0% recurring monthly fee)            │ but don\u0027t want to run an agency.│\n├───────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────┤\n│ **2. Turnkey Vertical Spaces**│ **$99 – $499 / MONTH Recurring**      │ Solution builders \u0026 agencies who│\n│ *(e.g. LexPulse Legal Cowork, │ (Developer earns 40% / 20% recurring  │ package complete industry desks │\n│  Miami Dental Phone Desk)*    │  commissions for life of the client)  │ and pitch them to businesses.   │\n└───────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n# 3. Base Cost Floor Protection \u0026 Dynamic First-Month Invoicing\n\nTo ensure that **neither you nor third-party plugin authors ever lose money**, the platform enforces a **Dynamic Price Floor**:\n\n$$\\text{Minimum First Month Price} \u003d \\text{Platform Base Plan} + \\sum \\text{Plugin One-Time Wholesale Fees}$$\n\n### How the Invoicing Lifecycle Works:\n\n```\n[ Business Subscribes to \"LexPulse Legal Studio\" Template ($150/mo) ]\nTemplate bundles 2 Paid Plugins: \n• Plugin A (M\u0026A Redliner): $20 one-time\n• Plugin B (Delaware Linter): $15 one-time\n                               │\n                               ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 🧾 MONTH 1 INVOICE (One Single Clean Charge to Client):                     │\n│ • Base Platform \u0026 Template Subscription:   $150.00                          │\n│ • Included Plugin A (One-Time License):     $20.00                          │\n│ • Included Plugin B (One-Time License):     $15.00                          │\n│ ───────────────────────────────────────────────────                         │\n│ 💳 **TOTAL FIRST MONTH CHARGE:**           **$185.00**                      │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ ⚡ AUTOMATIC EDGE SETTLEMENT (Cloudflare Billing Split):                     │\n│ • $20.00 instantly deposited to Plugin A Author\u0027s wallet.                   │\n│ • $15.00 instantly deposited to Plugin B Author\u0027s wallet.                   │\n│ • $60.00 (40%) deposited to Template Developer\u0027s monthly ledger.            │\n│ • $90.00 retained by Platform (covers compute, hosting \u0026 gross margin).     │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                               │\n                               ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 🧾 MONTH 2+ RECURRING INVOICE:                                              │\n│ Plugins are now fully paid and permanently licensed to that space!          │\n│ 💳 **ONGOING MONTHLY CHARGE:**             **$150.00 / month**              │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n#### On-Demand In-Space Plugin Store:\nIf a business owner opts out of paid plugins during initial signup, those plugins still appear in their project workspace—but in an **inactive/locked state**:\n* The user clicks on the grayed-out plugin tab:  \n  \u003e `🔒 \"Unlock M\u0026A Redline Micro-App for $20 (One-Time Purchase) — [ Buy \u0026 Unlock Now ]\"`\n* Buying it charges $20 once, settles the developer payout instantly, and activates the micro-app in their space permanently.\n\n---\n\n# 4. Eliminating User Confusion: The \"One Space \u003d One Invoice\" Rule\n\nTo prevent users from receiving multiple confusing charges, enforce **Space-Centric Billing with Free User Identity**:\n\n```\n                                  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n                                  │           FREE USER IDENTITY (Alice)         │\n                                  │      Login, email, credentials: $0.00        │\n                                  └──────────────────────┬───────────────────────┘\n                                                         │\n                         ┌───────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────┐\n                         ▼                                                               ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐   ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 🏢 SPACE 1: \"Alice Design Studio\" (Owned by Alice)          │   │ 🏢 SPACE 2: \"Bob\u0027s Law Firm\" (Alice is Invited Employee)   │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤   ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ • **Billing Entity:** Alice\u0027s Credit Card / Wallet.         │   │ • **Billing Entity:** Bob\u0027s Corporate Account.              │\n│ • **Monthly Charge:** **$29.00 / mo** (1 Clean Invoice).    │   │ • **Alice Pays:** **$0.00** (Bob\u0027s company pays for her).   │\n│ • Covers: Her template, hosting, plugins \u0026 AI compute.      │   │ • Covers: All firm projects, legal plugins, and staff seats.│\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### The 3 Golden Rules of Space Billing:\n1. **User Accounts are 100% Free:** An individual human never pays just to have an account. They can be invited to 20 different company workspaces without paying anything.\n2. **The Space is the Billing Anchor:** Every company/business workspace has **ONE single monthly subscription** tied to its primary billing card or business wallet (`SpaceDO.wallet_ledger`).\n3. **One Combined Invoice:** That single space invoice consolidates the template base price, team seats, one-time plugin additions, and metered compute.\n\n---\n\n# 5. The Complete Financial \u0026 Settlement Flow\n\n```typescript\n// workers/billing/src/settlement.ts\nexport async function processSpaceInvoiceCheckout(\n  db: D1Database,\n  spaceId: string,\n  templateId: string,\n  selectedPluginIds: string[],\n  isFirstMonth: boolean\n) {\n  // 1. Fetch Template \u0026 Plugin pricing\n  const template \u003d await getTemplateManifest(templateId);\n  const plugins \u003d await getPluginManifests(selectedPluginIds);\n\n  const baseMonthlyCents \u003d template.monthlyPriceCents; // e.g. $150.00\n  let firstTimePluginTotalCents \u003d 0;\n\n  // 2. Calculate one-time plugin costs for Month 1\n  if (isFirstMonth) {\n    for (const plugin of plugins) {\n      if (plugin.oneOffPriceCents) {\n        firstTimePluginTotalCents +\u003d plugin.oneOffPriceCents;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  const totalInvoiceCents \u003d baseMonthlyCents + firstTimePluginTotalCents;\n\n  // 3. Automated Split Settlement on Month 1:\n  if (isFirstMonth \u0026\u0026 firstTimePluginTotalCents \u003e 0) {\n    for (const plugin of plugins) {\n      if (plugin.oneOffPriceCents) {\n        // 100% of one-time plugin fee goes directly to Plugin Creator\n        await creditDeveloperWallet(db, plugin.authorUserId, plugin.oneOffPriceCents, \"plugin_license_sale\");\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Settle recurring template split (40% dev / 60% platform)\n  const templateDevCut \u003d Math.round(baseMonthlyCents * (template.attributionRate || 0.40));\n  const platformCut \u003d baseMonthlyCents - templateDevCut;\n\n  await creditDeveloperWallet(db, template.authorUserId, templateDevCut, \"template_recurring_cut\");\n\n  return {\n    totalBilledCents: totalInvoiceCents,\n    recurringNextMonthCents: baseMonthlyCents,\n    status: \"SETTLED\"\n  };\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Summary of What This Creates:\n\n1. **Rich Plugin Bundles:** Plugins are not just UI tabs—they package **interactive MCP-UI Micro-Apps (with dedicated DO Facet SQLite DBs)**, custom CodeMode scripts, and domain linters into clean, reusable capability packs.\n2. **Two Complementary Marketplaces:** Specialist developers sell **$10–$30 one-time plugins**; agency/solution builders package plugins into **$99–$499/mo vertical spaces**.\n3. **Protected Price Floors:** Formula enforcement ensures platform compute and third-party plugin authors are paid upfront on Month 1.\n4. **Single-Invoice Simplicity:** The business customer sees one clean, transparent charge; Cloudflare\u0027s settlement engine handles all multi-party splits automatically behind the scenes.",
