      "parts": [{
        "text": "This maps directly to Cloudflare’s **Cloudflare OS (August 2026)**"
      }, {
        "text": " release, which introduced **Gadgets** (isolated, per-document/per-tool sandboxes on Dynamic Workers with DO"
      }, {
        "text": " Facets), **Blueprints** (shareable gadget templates), and **Gatekeepers** (the capability-based security model)"
      }, {
        "text": ".\n\nHere is how we integrate **Project Canvas Viewports**, **Stateless Version"
      }, {
        "text": "ed Artifacts**, and **On-Demand Stateful Gadgets**, complete with **MCP-UI streaming** and **Cross"
      }, {
        "text": "-Subspace/Cross-Department permission delegation**.\n\n---\n\n# 1. The 3-Tier Canvas,"
      }, {
        "text": " Artifact, \u0026 Micro-App Hierarchy\n\n```\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                                   THE 3-TIER AR"
      }, {
        "text": "TIFACT \u0026 APP HIERARCHY                                     │\n├────────────────────┬─────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────"
      }, {
        "text": "─┤\n│ Tier Level         │ Execution \u0026 State       │ Underlying Cloudflare Tech │ Primary Purpose               │\n├────────────────────┼─────────────────────────┼"
      }, {
        "text": "────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤\n│ **Tier 1: Canvas** │ **Live Workspace View** │ `@"
      }, {
        "text": "cloudflare/computer` +   │ Deep project UI extensions    │\n│ **Viewports**      │ (Direct File Access)"
      }, {
        "text": "    │ Project SQLite Virtual FS  │ (Code Editor, Redliner, Comps)│\n├────────────────────┼─────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────"
      }, {
        "text": "┼───────────────────────────────┤\n│ **Tier 2: Versioned│ **Stateless Snapshots** │ Cloud"
      }, {
        "text": "flare Artifacts       │ Ephemeral deliverables (PDFs, │\n│ **Artifacts**      │ (Immutable Git Commits) │ (Zig"
      }, {
        "text": "-Wasm Git Server in DO)│ SVGs, static HTML previews)   │\n├────────────────────┼─────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────"
      }, {
        "text": "───────┤\n│ **Tier 3: Stateful │ **Living Mini-Apps**    │ **Dynamic Workers +**"
      }, {
        "text": "      │ Full-stack vibe-coded apps    │\n│ **Gadgets**        │ (Dedicated Database)    │ **DO Facets ("
      }, {
        "text": "SQLite DB)**  │ (Leave Tracker, Bug Matrix)   │\n└────────────────────┴─────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────"
      }, {
        "text": "┴───────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### Tier 1: Project Canvas Viewports (Workspace-Bound UI)"
      }, {
        "text": "\n* **What it is:** Extends the Project Kind\u0027s main workspace viewport (e.g. `Code"
      }, {
        "text": "Workspace` for `product_dev`, `DocumentRedlineCanvas` for `doc_studio`, `SpreadsheetFormulaGrid"
      }, {
        "text": "` for `finance_grid`).\n* **Storage \u0026 Access:** Directly attached to the project\u0027s **authoritative SQLite Virtual Filesystem**"
      }, {
        "text": " (`@cloudflare/computer`).\n* **Behavior:** When an agent runs `Edit` or `Write"
      }, {
        "text": "`, this canvas hot-reloads the changes live over WebSockets in sub-150ms.\n\n---\n\n### Tier 2: Stateless /"
      }, {
        "text": " Versioned Artifacts (Claude Artifacts on Cloudflare)\n* **What it is:** Ephemeral, versioned deliverables generated during"
      }, {
        "text": " conversation turns (e.g., a static SVG flowchart, a compiled PDF invoice, or an interactive React chart).\n* **Storage \u0026 Version"
      }, {
        "text": "ing:** Stored as immutable commits inside **Cloudflare Artifacts (Git for Agents)**.\n* **Behavior:** Users can scrub"
      }, {
        "text": " the thread history like a time machine and click **[Fork Artifact]** or **[Revert Workspace to this Commit]**"
      }, {
        "text": ".\n\n---\n\n### Tier 3: On-Demand Stateful Micro-Apps (\"Cloudflare OS Gadgets\")\n* **What it is:** A full-stack, living"
      }, {
        "text": " micro-application (built from a prompt in 30 seconds) that holds **its own private database and business logic**"
      }, {
        "text": ".\n* **Storage \u0026 Execution:**\n  * **Frontend:** Sandboxed in"
      }, {
        "text": " a null-origin `\u003ciframe\u003e` that communicates with the server via **Cap\u0027n Web RPC / MCP-UI**"
      }, {
        "text": ".\n  * **Backend \u0026 Database:** Runs inside a **Dynamic Worker isolate** backed by an isolated **D"
