h, are universally accessible yet secure, leveraging the Universal Vault Layer with `SpaceDO` / `space_credentials` and encryption. The process involves injecting tokens via `mcp-hub` and utilizing `ctx.vault.fetchWithAuth()` in V8 Isolates. The Cloudflare Sandbox Outbound Worker also performs a critical role in the container CLI context.\n\n\n**Investigating Zero-Trust Egress**\n\nI\u0027m now zeroing in on the zero-trust egress proxy. Specifically, I\u0027m examining TLS interception where tokens are injected dynamically when the container calls external services like GitHub or Stripe. The token never touches the container\u0027s filesystem! Further investigation is ongoing regarding V8 Raw HTTP calls, and the role of the zero-trust egress proxy.\n\n\n",
