  <div class="sec" id="rebrand">
    <span class="sec-ey">00 — Rebrand</span>
    <h2>Naelao — Not Suna</h2>
    <div class="bar"></div>
    <p class="lead">Everything previously called CF-Suna, suna, or suna-kortix in this codebase is now called
      <strong>Naelao</strong>. This is not a cosmetic rename — it affects every file path, every environment variable,
      every Worker name, every package name, every database table prefix, every R2 bucket name, and every public-facing
      URL. Do this rename <em>before</em> writing a single line of application code.</p>

    <h3>What Changes — The Complete Rename Checklist</h3>
    <p>A junior developer's most common mistake at this step is doing a partial rename — changing names in the frontend
      but forgetting Worker names, or changing package names but leaving environment variables. The following table is
      exhaustive. Every row must be renamed before proceeding.</p>

