    </table>

    <div class="warn-box">
      <div class="warn-label">⚠ Common Junior Dev Mistake</div>
      <p>Do NOT do a global find-and-replace of "suna" → "naelao" across the entire codebase blindly. The upstream
        <strong>kortix-ai/suna</strong> attribution must stay in comments and in the LICENSE file. The AgentPress tool
        names in the system prompt (like <span class="ic">computer_call</span>, <span class="ic">web_search</span>) do
        NOT change — these are API contracts between the agent and Anthropic's tool use schema. Only change
        infrastructure and brand names, never protocol names.</p>
    </div>

    <h3>Automated Rename Script</h3>
    <p>Run this once at project init. Never run it again — it is destructive if run on partially-renamed code.</p>
    <pre><code><span class="cm">#!/bin/bash
# scripts/rename-to-naelao.sh
# Run ONCE at project start. Never again.
# Renames all infrastructure references from cf-suna → naelao</span>

set -e

<span class="cm"># 1. Worker names in wrangler.jsonc files</span>
find . -name "wrangler.jsonc" -exec sed -i \
  's/cf-suna-/naelao-/g; s/"suna-/"naelao-/g' {} \;

<span class="cm"># 2. Package names</span>
find . -name "package.json" -exec sed -i \
  's/@cf-suna\//@naelao\//g; s/"cf-suna"/"naelao"/g' {} \;

<span class="cm"># 3. Environment variable names (not values)</span>
find . -name "*.ts" -o -name "*.tsx" -o -name "*.js" | xargs sed -i \
  's/env\.SUNA_/env.NAELAO_/g; s/SUNA_API_KEY/NAELAO_API_KEY/g'

<span class="cm"># 4. R2 bucket binding names</span>
grep -r "cf-suna-workspace\|cf-suna-assets" . --include="*.jsonc" -l | \
  xargs sed -i 's/cf-suna-workspace/naelao-workspace/g; s/cf-suna-assets/naelao-assets/g'

<span class="cm"># 5. Container name prefixes in SandboxDO</span>
find . -name "sandbox-do.ts" -exec sed -i \
  's/suna-agent-/naelao-agent-/g; s/suna-assistant-/naelao-assistant-/g' {} \;

echo "✓ Rename complete. Run: git diff --stat to verify scope."
echo "⚠ Manually verify: 1) License/attribution comments, 2) AgentPress tool names, 3) SpaceDO table schema matches workers/naelao-spaces/src/dos/SpaceDO.ts"</code></pre>
  </div>

