  <div class="sec" id="topology">
    <span class="sec-ey">02 — System Topology</span>
    <h2>Complete System Architecture — All 22 Workers</h2>
    <div class="bar"></div>
    <p class="lead">Naelao is a distributed system of 22 Cloudflare Workers connected via Service Bindings —
      zero-latency internal RPC, no HTTP round-trips between internal services. Every Worker has exactly one
      responsibility. This section covers every Worker, its bindings, and its exact responsibilities.</p>

    <h3>Full Architecture Diagram</h3>
