    <h3>Worker Catalogue — Full Spec</h3>
    <p>Every Worker listed with its Service Bindings, exact responsibilities, and critical implementation notes for
      junior developers.</p>

    <div class="wcat">
      <div class="wi">
        <div class="wi-name">naelao-router</div>
        <div class="wi-type">Entry · All Traffic</div>
        <div class="wi-desc">The single public origin. Every request hits this first. Handles CORS, CF Access JWT
          validation on admin routes, WebSocket upgrade routing, rate limiting via KV, and Service Binding dispatch to
          downstream Workers. Contains <strong>zero business logic</strong> — if you find yourself adding a feature
          here, it belongs in a downstream Worker instead. Bindings: KV (naelao-config), Service Bindings to all 21
          other Workers.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="wi">
        <div class="wi-name">naelao-auth</div>
        <div class="wi-type">Service · Auth & RBAC</div>
        <div class="wi-desc">JWT verification (Naelao-native, no Supabase dependency). Space membership lookup from SpaceDO SQLite (the product's per-space DB — no external round-trips). RBAC role assertion (owner/admin/editor/member/viewer). Called via Service Binding from naelao-router on every protected request. Returns enriched identity: {userId, spaceId, role, rootSpaceId}.
          Bindings: SpaceDO, KV (session cache).</div>
      </div>
      <div class="wi">
        <div class="wi-name">naelao-agents</div>
        <div class="wi-type">Service · Agent Lifecycle</div>
        <div class="wi-desc">Agent definition CRUD (create, read, update, delete, version, import/export JSON).
          Marketplace API. AgentDO lifecycle management. Pre-flight checks before dispatch (concurrency limit via
          ConcurrencyDO, billing check via naelao-billing Service Binding). Routes run requests to AgentDO directly
          (foreground) or to CF Queue (background). Bindings: SpaceDO (product DB), NaelaoAgentDO, ConcurrencyDO, Queue: naelao-agent-runs.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="wi">
        <div class="wi-name">naelao-threads</div>
        <div class="wi-type">Service · Threads & Streaming</div>
        <div class="wi-desc">Thread + message CRUD. Streaming token forwarding from AgentDO WebSocket to client SSE/WS.
          withSpace() helper injects WHERE space_id = ? on every SpaceDO SQLite query — sub-space isolation within the product DB. GET /threads/:id/messages — returns paginated message history. Deduplication of streaming events. Bindings: SpaceDO (product DB), NaelaoAgentDO (WebSocket).</div>
      </div>
      <div class="wi">
        <div class="wi-name">naelao-spaces</div>
        <div class="wi-type">Service · Spaces & Sub-Spaces</div>
        <div class="wi-desc">Space CRUD, Sub-Space hierarchy (max 3 levels enforced), member management
          (invite/remove/role-change), project collaboration member access, resource registry (external containers).
          Quota enforcement: max sub-spaces, max members per tier. SpaceDO maintains member cache for fast auth.
          Bindings: SpaceDO (product DB — all reads/writes scoped to product's root SpaceDO), ProjectDO, ResourceRegistryDO.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="wi">
        <div class="wi-name">naelao-billing</div>
        <div class="wi-type">Service · Credits & Subscriptions</div>
        <div class="wi-desc">Credit ledger operations. Called by NaelaoAgentDO after every LLM response to record token
          usage. Stripe webhook handling (subscription created/cancelled/payment_failed). RevenueCat IAP for
          iOS/Android. Trial management (14-day, hard cutoff at trial_end). deductCredits(spaceId, tokens) must be
          atomic — use BEGIN IMMEDIATE transaction on SpaceDO SQLite, not two separate queries. Bindings: SpaceDO (product DB), Stripe Secret, RevenueCat Secret.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="wi">
        <div class="wi-name">naelao-knowledge</div>
        <div class="wi-type">Service · Knowledge Base</div>
        <div class="wi-desc">KB folder/entry CRUD. Document upload → R2 storage → Vectorize embedding. KB injection into
          agent context via SpaceDO.getLlmFormattedMessages() — the stored-function logic is now a typed DO method. Version history per document.
          Semantic search via Vectorize. Bindings: SpaceDO (product DB), R2 (naelao-workspace), Vectorize (naelao-kb-index).</div>
      </div>
      <div class="wi">
        <div class="wi-name">naelao-credentials</div>
        <div class="wi-type">Service · Encrypted Secrets</div>
        <div class="wi-desc">AES-256-GCM encryption/decryption via Web Crypto API (available natively in CF Workers — no
          library needed). Stores user MCP credential profiles. Called by NaelaoAgentDO via Service Binding at run start
          to inject MCP credentials into agent context without exposing them to agent code or logs. Bindings: SpaceDO (product DB), Secret: NAELAO_MCP_ENCRYPTION_KEY.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="wi">
        <div class="wi-name">naelao-mcp-hub</div>
        <div class="wi-type">Service · MCP Tool Proxy</div>
        <div class="wi-desc">MCP tool execution proxy. Receives tool call from AgentDO, routes to correct MCP server
          (user-configured or platform), returns result. Handles OAuth flows for MCP server auth. Caches tool schemas in
          KV to avoid repeated discovery calls. Bindings: SpaceDO (product DB), KV (mcp-tool-cache), naelao-credentials (Service Binding).</div>
      </div>
