  <div class="sep"></div>
  <div class="sec" id="pricing">
    <span class="sec-ey">30 — Pricing & Billing</span>
    <h2>Pricing Tiers, Billing Architecture & Credit System</h2>
    <div class="bar"></div>
    <p class="lead">The billing system is one of the most error-prone parts of any platform. An incorrect deduction
      means either losing revenue or overcharging users — both erode trust. This section covers the complete pricing
      structure and the exact implementation of every billing event.</p>

