    <h3>Billing &amp; Metering — Per-Container Slots</h3>
    <p>Each marketplace container slot is metered independently. The billing system tracks container-hours per slot, not
      just a single sandbox figure. Marketplace containers may carry a markup over Naelao's raw CF Container cost — this
      is how community image publishers earn revenue (similar to how Apps have an install fee, Marketplace containers
      can have a monthly slot fee split between the publisher and Naelao). Local machine slots are free of cloud compute
      cost but still count toward the user's project slot limit (free plan: 1 slot, pro: 5 slots, enterprise:
      unlimited).</p>

    <pre><code><span class="cm">// Billing event emitted per container slot per minute of active run time</span>

interface ContainerBillingEvent {
  spaceId:     string;
  projectId:   string;
  slotId:      string;
  imageId:     string;
  type:        'base' | 'marketplace' | 'local';
  startedAt:   number;
  stoppedAt:   number;
  durationMs:  number;
  <span class="cm">// billing rate looked up from imageId — base is $0.015/hr, marketplace varies</span>
  rateCentsPerHour: number;
  chargedCents:     number;
}</code></pre>

