<span class="cm"># Generate a proper 32-byte encryption key:</span>
node -e "console.log(Buffer.from(crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint8Array(32))).toString('base64'))"
<span class="cm"># Copy the output as NAELAO_MCP_ENCRYPTION_KEY</span></code></pre>

    <h3>Step 5 — Run Tests</h3>
