        <div class="card-title">Query Layer</div>
        <p>Sales VP asks Mini-AGI. Mini-AGI checks access permissions, queries the sales data domain in real time,
          returns synthesized answer in seconds. HR data still invisible to VP.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card gr">
        <div class="card-lbl">With Mini-AGI (Advanced)</div>
        <div class="card-title">Action Layer</div>
        <p>Sales VP asks Mini-AGI about a deal at risk. Mini-AGI identifies the technical issue from engineering
          tickets, checks customer health from support data, drafts a rescue plan — all in one response, all
          data-permission-gated.</p>
