      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td class="mono">/warm</td>
          <td class="tl">POST</td>
          <td>Pre-warm the DO — runs initSchema() so first message is faster. Fire-and-forget.</td>
          <td>Creates SQLite tables if not present. Sets spaceId, agentId in storage.</td>
