          <td class="tl"><strong>Security Events Spike</strong></td>
          <td>Run SECURITY_EVENT_TIMELINE to identify attack type. If from authenticated users (valid JWTs), query
            <code>GET /_admin/audit/{spaceId}</code> and suspend the space if needed.</td>
          <td>Enable CF Bot Management's "Definitely Automated" challenge mode for high volume — does not affect
            authenticated API calls.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="tl"><strong>DLQ Depth Growing</strong></td>
          <td><code>GET /_admin/dlq/messages</code> to inspect payloads. Identify the common error. Check git log for
            recent code changes to the queue's consumer Worker.</td>
          <td>Fix bug → deploy. Reprocess with <code>POST /_admin/dlq/retry/{messageId}</code>. Bulk retry via the ops
            playbook drain script.</td>
        </tr>
