            <td>Named workspaces with shared file context and KB</td>
            <td>3 / Unlimited</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="tl"><strong>Agent execution</strong></td>
            <td>Chat loop with tool calling. Default tier: Isolate.</td>
            <td>100 runs/day / Unlimited</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="tl"><strong>R2 storage</strong></td>
            <td>Per-project file storage under <code>workspace/projects/{projectId}/</code></td>
            <td>1 GB / 10 GB</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="tl"><strong>Skills</strong></td>
            <td>file-manager, web-search always loaded. Any platform skill can be enabled.</td>
            <td>All platform skills available</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="tl"><strong>Apps</strong></td>
            <td>Any published Naelao App can be installed</td>
            <td>5 apps / Unlimited</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
