      <div class="box box-gr">
        <div class="box-lbl">Standard as the Default Fallback</div>
        <p>If any part of the Space Type system fails — the manifest is missing, the registry is unreachable, the
          provisioner returns an error — the platform falls back to Standard. This means a degraded Naelao is still a
          functional Naelao: threads work, file manager works, the agent responds. No other Space Type can make this
          guarantee because they all depend on additional DOs or migrations that may themselves be unavailable.</p>
