      <div class="sec" id="space-type-registry-appendix">
        <span class="sec-ey">A4 — Space Type Registry</span>
        <h2>SpaceTypeRegistryDO — The Marketplace & Versioning Engine</h2>
        <div class="bar"></div>
        <p class="lead">The <code>SpaceTypeRegistryDO</code> is the only global singleton Durable Object in Naelao. It
          serves as the authoritative source for all available Space Types, managing the full lifecycle from submission
          through canary rollout to deprecation. <em>See §62 for the provisioner and §76 for canary rollout mechanics —
            this appendix covers what those sections omit: the KV cache invalidation flow, the earnings micropayment
            ledger, and the deprecation pipeline.</em></p>

        <h3>KV Cache Invalidation — The Read-Through Pattern</h3>
        <p>The RegistryDO is a global singleton, which means every manifest read that goes to the DO adds cross-region
          latency. To avoid this, <code>naelao-spaces</code> reads manifests from CF KV first. The DO is only consulted
          on cache miss. This gives ~1ms reads at the global edge instead of ~50ms to the DO's pinned location.</p>
        <pre><code><span class="cm">// workers/spaces/index.ts — How naelao-spaces resolves a manifest</span>

async function resolveSpaceTypeManifest(
  typeId: string,
  version: string,
  env: Env
): Promise&lt;NaelaoSpaceTypeManifestV2&gt; {
  
  const cacheKey = `manifest:${typeId}:${version}`;

  <span class="cm">// 1. Try KV first (sub-1ms from any PoP)</span>
  const cached = await env.NAELAO_CONFIG_KV.get(cacheKey, 'json');
  if (cached) return cached as NaelaoSpaceTypeManifestV2;

  <span class="cm">// 2. KV miss — go to the registry DO (one round-trip to DO's location)</span>
  const registryId = env.NAELAO_REGISTRY_DO.idFromName('global-registry');
  const registry = env.NAELAO_REGISTRY_DO.get(registryId);

  const resp = await registry.fetch(new Request('http://registry/manifest', {
    method: 'POST',
    body: JSON.stringify({ typeId, version })
  }));

  if (!resp.ok) throw new Error(`Space Type '${typeId}@${version}' not found`);
  const manifest = await resp.json() as NaelaoSpaceTypeManifestV2;

  <span class="cm">// 3. Populate KV so subsequent reads are fast</span>
  <span class="cm">// TTL: 1 hour. The DO calls broadcastUpdate() to invalidate when a type changes.</span>
  await env.NAELAO_CONFIG_KV.put(cacheKey, JSON.stringify(manifest), {
    expirationTtl: 3600
  });

  return manifest;
}

<span class="cm">// Inside SpaceTypeRegistryDO — called on any version publish or status change</span>
async function broadcastUpdate(typeId: string, version: string): Promise&lt;void&gt; {
  <span class="cm">// Delete the KV cache entry. Next read from any Worker will repopulate it.</span>
  await this.env.NAELAO_CONFIG_KV.delete(`manifest:${typeId}:${version}`);

  <span class="cm">// Also invalidate the 'latest' pointer if this is the current version</span>
  const spaceType = this.ctx.storage.sql.exec(
    `SELECT current_version FROM space_types WHERE id = ?`, typeId
  ).one();

  if (spaceType?.current_version === version) {
    await this.env.NAELAO_CONFIG_KV.delete(`manifest:${typeId}:latest`);
  }

  <span class="cm">// Notify naelao-admin of the update for audit logging</span>
  await this.env.NAELAO_ANALYTICS_QUEUE.send({
    type: 'registry_update',
    typeId, version,
    timestamp: Date.now()
  });
}</code></pre>

        <h3>Earnings Micropayment Ledger</h3>
        <p>When a Space uses a community-authored Space Type (currently Naelao-authored only, but community contribution
          is planned), the platform deducts a usage fee and credits the type's author. This is tracked in the
          RegistryDO's <code>registry_earnings</code> table and settled to the author's Stripe Connect account weekly.
        </p>
        <pre><code><span class="cm">// Called by naelao-billing whenever a Space is billed for a community Space Type</span>
async function recordTypeUsage(params: {
  typeId: string;
  sourceSpaceId: string;
  monthlyBilledUsd: number;
}): Promise&lt;void&gt; {

  <span class="cm">// Community authors earn 20% of the Space Type's monthly fee</span>
  const AUTHOR_REVENUE_SHARE = 0.20;

  const authorEarnings = params.monthlyBilledUsd * AUTHOR_REVENUE_SHARE;

  <span class="cm">// Look up the author of this Space Type</span>
  const spaceType = this.ctx.storage.sql.exec(
    `SELECT author_id FROM space_types WHERE id = ?`, params.typeId
  ).one();

  if (!spaceType || spaceType.author_id === 'naelao') {
    return; <span class="cm">// Platform-native types don't pay out to an author</span>
  }

  <span class="cm">// Write to the earnings ledger</span>
  this.ctx.storage.sql.exec(`
    INSERT INTO registry_earnings (author_id, amount_usd, source_space_id)
    VALUES (?, ?, ?)
  `, spaceType.author_id, authorEarnings, params.sourceSpaceId);

  <span class="cm">// Update the Space Type's total revenue counter</span>
  this.ctx.storage.sql.exec(
    `UPDATE space_types SET total_revenue_usd = total_revenue_usd + ? WHERE id = ?`,
    authorEarnings, params.typeId
  );
}

<span class="cm">// Weekly settlement job (called by naelao-sweeper cron)</span>
async function settleEarnings(env: Env): Promise&lt;void&gt; {
  <span class="cm">// Find all authors with unsettled earnings</span>
  const pendingEarnings = this.ctx.storage.sql.exec(`
    SELECT author_id, SUM(amount_usd) as total_due
    FROM registry_earnings
    WHERE settled = 0
    GROUP BY author_id
    HAVING total_due >= 10.00
  `).toArray();

  for (const row of pendingEarnings) {
    <span class="cm">// Look up the author's Stripe Connect account ID from SpaceDO SQLite</span>
    const spaceDO = getProductDO(rootSpaceId, env);  // SpaceDO replaces Hyperdrive
    const author = await db.query(
      `SELECT stripe_connect_account_id FROM user_profiles WHERE id = $1`,
      [row.author_id]
    );

    if (!author.rows[0]?.stripe_connect_account_id) continue;

    <span class="cm">// Transfer via Stripe Connect</span>
    const transfer = await fetch('https://api.stripe.com/v1/transfers', {
      method: 'POST',
      headers: {
        'Authorization': `Bearer ${env.STRIPE_SECRET_KEY}`,
        'Content-Type': 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'
      },
      body: new URLSearchParams({
        amount: String(Math.floor((row.total_due as number) * 100)), <span class="cm">// cents</span>
        currency: 'usd',
        destination: author.rows[0].stripe_connect_account_id,
        description: 'Naelao Space Type Author Revenue Share'
      })
    }).then(r => r.json());

    if (transfer.id) {
      <span class="cm">// Mark as settled</span>
      this.ctx.storage.sql.exec(
        `UPDATE registry_earnings SET settled = 1, stripe_transfer_id = ? WHERE author_id = ? AND settled = 0`,
        transfer.id, row.author_id
      );
    }
  }
}
</code></pre>

        <h3>Deprecation Pipeline</h3>
        <p>When a Space Type is deprecated, existing Spaces using it are not broken immediately. The deprecation
          pipeline notifies admins, gives them a migration window, and finally marks the type as <code>archived</code> —
          at which point no new Spaces can use it but existing ones remain functional until they migrate.</p>
        <pre><code><span class="cm">// Deprecation state machine: approved → deprecated → archived</span>
<span class="cm">// Transition from deprecated → archived requires a 90-day notice period.</span>

async function deprecateSpaceType(typeId: string, migrationGuideUrl: string): Promise&lt;void&gt; {
  const archiveDate = new Date();
  archiveDate.setDate(archiveDate.getDate() + 90); <span class="cm">// 90-day window</span>

  this.ctx.storage.sql.exec(
    `UPDATE space_types SET status = 'deprecated', archive_date = ?, migration_guide_url = ? WHERE id = ?`,
    archiveDate.getTime(), migrationGuideUrl, typeId
  );

  <span class="cm">// Notify all Space admins using this type</span>
  const spaceDO = getProductDO(this.rootSpaceId, this.env);  // SpaceDO replaces Hyperdrive
  const affected = await db.query(
    `SELECT DISTINCT s.admin_user_id FROM spaces s WHERE s.space_type_id = $1`,
    [typeId]
  );

  for (const row of affected.rows) {
    await this.env.NAELAO_NOTIFICATIONS_QUEUE.send({
      type: 'space_type_deprecated',
      userId: row.admin_user_id,
      typeId,
      archiveDate: archiveDate.toISOString(),
      migrationGuideUrl,
      message: `Space Type '${typeId}' will be archived on ${archiveDate.toLocaleDateString()}. Please migrate to a supported type before then.`
    });
  }

  await this.broadcastUpdate(typeId, 'status-change');
}</code></pre>

        <div class="box box-pu">
          <div class="box-lbl">The Canary Rollout Protocol</div>
          <p>Naelao supports <strong>Canary Provisioning</strong> for Space Types. When a Minor version (v1.1.0) is
            published, the Registry DO sets <code>canary_percent</code> to 5%. For the next 24 hours, only 5% of new
            Spaces created with that Type will use the new manifest. The <code>naelao-analytics</code> Worker monitors
            these canary instances for error rate spikes. If the error rate stays below 5%, the registry auto-promotes
            through 5% → 20% → 100% over 48 hours. See §76 for the full canary rollout implementation.</p>
        </div>
        <h3>Complete DO SQLite Schema</h3>
        <pre><code><span class="cm">// durable-objects/space-type-registry-do.ts
