        <div class="box box-or">
          <div class="box-lbl">The "No-Container-Fulfillment" Rule</div>
          <p>For <code>Launchpad</code> and <code>Workers</code> Space Types, set
            <code>containerIdleTimeoutMs: 0</code>. Fulfillment tasks (verify Stripe, send email, call an API, update a
            database) are purely API-driven — they never need a Linux shell. The isolate tier executes these in a V8
            Worker in &lt;10ms. Enabling containers here would add $0.015/hour/space in idle costs at zero benefit. This
            is the key to profitability at low plan prices.</p>
        </div>

        <h3>Context Compaction — When maxContextTokens Is Exceeded</h3>
        <p>When the rolling token count of the agent's conversation history exceeds <code>maxContextTokens</code>, the
          orchestrator triggers compaction instead of letting the LLM hit its hard context limit (which causes a fatal
          error). Compaction is transparent to the user.</p>
        <pre><code><span class="cm">// agentpress/context-manager.ts</span>

async function compactIfNeeded(
  session: SessionManager,
  maxTokens: number,
  env: Env
): Promise&lt;void&gt; {
  const currentTokens = session.estimateTokens();

  if (currentTokens &lt; maxTokens * 0.9) return; <span class="cm">// 90% threshold</span>

  <span class="cm">// Summarize the oldest 50% of messages</span>
  const messages = session.getMessages();
  const cutoff = Math.floor(messages.length * 0.5);
  const toSummarize = messages.slice(0, cutoff);

  const summary = await env.AI_GATEWAY.messages.create({
    model: 'claude-haiku-4-5', <span class="cm">// Use the cheapest model for compaction</span>
    max_tokens: 1000,
    messages: [{ role: 'user', content: `Summarize this conversation history into a concise checkpoint that preserves all critical facts, decisions, and file paths:\n\n${JSON.stringify(toSummarize)}` }]
  });

  <span class="cm">// Replace the old messages with a single summary block</span>
  session.compact(cutoff, summary.content[0].text);

  <span class="cm">// Write compact event to Analytics Engine (tracks how often compaction triggers)</span>
  await env.NAELAO_ANALYTICS_QUEUE.send({
    type: 'context_compaction',
    spaceId: session.spaceId,
    runId: session.runId,
    messagesCompacted: cutoff,
    tokensReduced: currentTokens - session.estimateTokens()
  });
}</code></pre>


