          <div class="box box-or">
            <div class="box-lbl">What the Scanner Cannot Catch</div>
            <p>The Scanner catches <em>structural</em> violations: undeclared bindings, illegal permissions, missing
              policies. It cannot catch <em>behavioral</em> violations — a DO that correctly declares read/write
              permissions but uses network allowlist access to exfiltrate data. This is why new domains in a Space
              Type's network allowlist receive manual engineer review before production deployment. The Scanner
              automates the mechanical gates; human review covers intent.</p>
          </div>
