          <h2>naelao-admin — Complete Platform Operations Worker</h2>
          <div class="bar"></div>
          <p class="lead">The full <code>naelao-admin</code> Worker beyond the §78 stub. Adds user management
            (ban/unban/impersonate), feature flag CRUD backed by KV, platform-wide metrics aggregation, emergency agent
            kill-switch, and DLQ replay tooling. All routes gated by Cloudflare Zero Trust — no product JWT accepted
