          <div class="box box-rd">
            <div class="box-lbl">Security: Why CF Access, Not Supabase JWT</div>
            <p>Product-scoped JWTs are issued to end-users. A compromised user account or a bug in the auth flow could
              escalate to admin. CF Access tokens are issued by Cloudflare's Zero Trust infrastructure, tied to email
              identity + device posture + short-lived MTLS certificates. An attacker who steals a product JWT cannot
              forge a CF Access token. Admin endpoints live at a separate subdomain (<code>admin.naelao.dev</code>) with
              Zero Trust enforced at the network edge, before the request reaches the Worker.</p>
