          <h3>Studio Knowledge Base — What Makes It Different</h3>
          <p>Every Studio Space has a structured knowledge base with specific document roles. These are not generic
            uploads — they are typed documents that agents actively reference at defined points in the production
            pipeline. A document without a type is treated as general reference and weighted lower in retrieval.</p>

