        <div class="box box-gr" style="margin-top:12px;">
          <div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div>
          <p>Required Fix All `window.addEventListener('message', handler)` calls in app iframe code must check `if (event.origin !== 'https://app.naelao.dev') return;`. This must be enforced in the `@naelao/portal-sdk` which all apps are required to use. The shell's `postMessage` handler for incoming `APP_ACTION` messages must verify the iframe's registered `panelUrl` origin matches `event.origin` before processing any action. Add a Content-Security-Policy on all app iframes: `frame-ancestors 'self' https://app.naelao.dev` to prevent third-party embedding of app panels. Severity: High — Missing origin validation in app iframes is a classic XSS via postMessage attack. A compromised or malicious app can spoof shell context and execute agent actions in arbitrary spaces. T-135 — Operator Shell Slot System</p>
