          <p>Workflow Path Validation — startsWith Check Vulnerable to Prefix Injection The Dynamic Workflow loadRunner validates the workflow path with: `if (!workflowPath.startsWith(`spaces/${spaceId}/`)) throw Error`. This check is incomplete. An attacker in Space A (ID: `abc-123`) could craft a workflow path like `spaces/abc-123-evil/workflows/backdoor.ts`. If there is a Space with ID `abc-123-evil` (created by the attacker in a different organization), the startsWith check passes and the backdoor workflow is loaded with Space A's context. The fix is using exact directory matching, not prefix matching.</p>
