          <p>Required Fix Add explicit path validation in the file-manager skill implementation before any R2 operation: reject paths containing '..', reject absolute paths (starting with /), reject paths with leading whitespace. Validate using a whitelist pattern: `/^[a-zA-Z0-9._/-]+$/` (allow only safe characters). Throw a clear error if validation fails: "Path must be relative, no '..', no leading '/'." Severity: Medium — Path validation is only in the skill description, not enforced at runtime. Agents could attempt to read files outside the workspace. T-159 — Prompt Engineering</p>
