          <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--or);background:rgba(232,105,42,.12);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;">G-SEC-08</span>
          <h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hd);letter-spacing:-.01em;">Memory Context Injection — Max 20 Items; Older Memories Silently Discarded Without Archival</h3>
