        <div class="box box-gr" style="margin-top:12px;">
          <div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div>
          <p>Required Fix Implement AST-based analysis instead of regex patterns. Parse the SKILL.md as JavaScript/TypeScript and analyze the AST for dangerous API calls (process, require, import, eval, Function, etc). Sandbox skill execution: run unverified skills in a restricted V8 isolate with no access to process, require, or file system. This defense-in-depth approach catches both obvious and obfuscated attacks. Require code signing for unverified skills: skills must be signed by their author. If a signature check fails, the skill is automatically blocked. Severity: Medium — 27-pattern scanner uses simple regex matching. Obfuscated dangerous patterns bypass the filter. Unverified skills can still execute dangerous code. T-165 — Bootstrap Mode</p>
