        <div class="box box-rd">
          <div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div>
          <p>Manifest Signature Validation — Skipped If Signature Missing; Manifests Loaded Unsigned The provisioner fetches space type manifests from SpaceTypeRegistryDO. The spec says: "The manifest's Ed25519 signature is verified against the platform public key." However, the code doesn't explicitly show what happens if the signature is missing or validation fails. If SpaceTypeRegistryDO returns a manifest without a signature field, the validation code likely skips the check and loads the manifest as-is. This allows a compromised SpaceTypeRegistryDO (or a middle-layer attacker) to serve a modified manifest with malicious agent environment configs (e.g., disabledSkills: [], maxContextTokens: 1000000)…</p>
