        <div class="box box-gr" style="margin-top:12px;">
          <div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div>
          <p>Required Fix Require manifest.signature field to always be present. If missing, throw "Manifest signature required". Verify the signature before using ANY field from the manifest. A missing or invalid signature invalidates the entire manifest, not just a single field. Pin the public key in the code, not in a config. Rotating the key is a platform-wide event requiring code deployment. Severity: High — Missing signature validation on manifests. Malicious manifests can be loaded unsigned. Attackers can modify agent configs or disable safety features. T-177 — Provisioner</p>
