        </div>
        <div class="box box-rd">
          <div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div>
          <p>SSO Config OIDC Secret — Encrypted In Secrets Store; No Key Rotation; Decryption Fails On Key Change OIDC client secrets are stored encrypted using Cloudflare Secrets Store. The encryption key is managed by Cloudflare and there's no explicit key rotation mechanism exposed to the application. If Cloudflare rotates the master encryption key (for security or compliance), secrets encrypted with the old key may become inaccessible. The application has no way to re-encrypt old secrets with the new key. Additionally, if the secret is compromised and needs to be rotated, there's no automated rotation workflow — the builder must manually update the config in the UI. During the re-configuration…</p>
