          <h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hd);letter-spacing:-.01em;">Lifecycle Hooks — No Timeout Or Failure Recovery; Hook Hang Blocks Entire Provisioning</h3>
        </div>
