        </div>
        <pre style="background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--brd);border-radius:8px;padding:16px;overflow-x:auto;margin-top:12px;"><code style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--cy);line-height:1.6;">// Required: LaunchpadConfigWizard — runs BEFORE space creation, shapes the manifest
