          <h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hd);letter-spacing:-.01em;">UIOrchestrationDO Slot Conflict Resolution — Priority Tie-Breaking Is Unspecified</h3>
