        <div class="box box-rd">
          <div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div>
          <p>UIOrchestrationDO Slot Conflict Resolution — Priority Tie-Breaking Is Unspecified When a Space Type manifest pre-fills a slot (e.g., mini-agi pre-fills `sidebar`) and an installed App also declares it wants the `sidebar` slot, the spec says slots are "merged and de-conflicted by `UIOrchestrationDO`." No de-confliction algorithm is specified. The spec shows a table of 6 slot types. All 6 can be claimed by both the Space Type and multiple installed Apps simultaneously. Without a defined priority order (Space Type &gt; App, or first-installed &gt; later-installed, or admin-configured priority), the actual slot assignment is undefined and will be whatever the DO's SQL query happens to return first.…</p>
