        <div class="box box-gr" style="margin-top:12px;">
          <div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div>
          <p>Required Fix Define explicit slot priority: Space Type manifest &gt; App manifest (by install timestamp, earliest first) . Document this in the manifest spec and enforce it in `UIOrchestrationDO.resolveSlots()`. For slots that support multiple occupants (e.g., `sidebar` can have multiple icons), define max occupancy per slot type and enforce at install time. Publish an enum of valid `hiddenCoreItems` values. Fail manifest validation if an unknown ID is provided. Add a `GET /slots/debug` endpoint on the UIOrchestrationDO for admin inspection of current slot assignments. Severity: Medium — Undefined slot conflict resolution means the UI is non-deterministic when Space Types and Apps compete for the same slots. `hiddenCoreItems` with unknown IDs silently fails, making it impossible to verify…</p>
