        <div class="box box-gr" style="margin-top:12px;">
          <div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div>
          <p>Execute untrusted space code in true isolate isolation. Use CF Containers (Tier 5 execution) or CF Workers for Platforms (Dispatch Namespace) for any code that is not first-party. Each space script runs in its own isolated Worker with an independent 128 MB heap — an OOM in one space does not affect other spaces. Enforce a per-space CPU time budget using AbortController and a Race between the code execution and a setTimeout(reject, MAX_CPU_MS) wrapper. Document in the architecture principles: 'Untrusted code never executes in the host Worker's heap.'</p>
