  <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px);font-weight:700;color:var(--tx);margin:0 0 12px;">Critical Implementation Gaps — Security, Reliability &amp; Data Integrity</h2>
  <p style="color:#94A3B8;max-width:720px;line-height:1.7;">
    24 additional gaps identified in a fourth-pass review of the Naelao specification: 5 critical security
    vulnerabilities (cross-tenant leakage, domain hijacking, prompt injection, data exfiltration, broken core worker),
    14 high-severity reliability and abuse-vector issues, and 5 medium-severity issues covering test coverage,
    build-plan integrity, and subtle data loss scenarios.
  </p>
