<div style="margin:48px 0 0;padding:24px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #1E293B;">
  <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#EF4444;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;">CRITICAL SEVERITY — 9 GAPS</span>
</div>

<div id="GAP-291" style="margin:40px 0 0;padding:28px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--brd);">
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:6px;">
    <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--or);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;background:#E8692A18;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap;">GAP-291</span>
    <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#EF4444;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;background:#EF444418;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap;">CRITICAL</span>
    <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#64748B;padding:3px 8px;white-space:nowrap;">25b_naelao_eval.md / 28_wrangler_configs.md</span>
  </div>
  <h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:clamp(16px,2.5vw,22px);font-weight:600;color:var(--tx);margin:0 0 16px;">naelao-eval Wrangler Config Declares Wrong Binding (NAELAO_AGENTS) — All Five Real Bindings Are Missing</h3>
  <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The naelao-eval wrangler config in 28_wrangler_configs.md declares a single service binding: NAELAO_AGENTS -&gt; naelao-agents. The actual eval worker (25b_naelao_eval.md) uses five completely different bindings: TOGETHER_AI_SERVICE (service binding to naelao-together-ai), ANALYTICS_SERVICE (service binding to naelao-analytics), R2_EVAL_RESULTS (R2Bucket), KV_EVAL_LOCK (KVNamespace), and the secrets ADMIN_SECRET, EVAL_SPACE_ID, MAX_EVAL_CONCURRENCY. None of these appear in the wrangler config. NAELAO_AGENTS, which does appear, is never referenced by the eval worker at all. At runtime every binding access throws: "Cannot read properties of undefined".</p></div>
  <div class="box box-gr"><div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Replace the naelao-eval section in 28_wrangler_configs.md with the correct binding set:

// wrangler.jsonc – naelao-eval
{
  "services": [
    { "binding": "TOGETHER_AI_SERVICE", "service": "naelao-together-ai" },
    { "binding": "ANALYTICS_SERVICE",   "service": "naelao-analytics"   }
  ],
  "r2_buckets":  [{ "binding": "R2_EVAL_RESULTS", "bucket_name": "naelao-eval-results" }],
  "kv_namespaces": [{ "binding": "KV_EVAL_LOCK", "id": "&lt;KV_ID&gt;" }],
  "vars": {
    "EVAL_SPACE_ID": "&lt;space-id&gt;",
    "MAX_EVAL_CONCURRENCY": "4"
  }
}
// Secrets (via wrangler secret put): ADMIN_SECRET
// Remove the NAELAO_AGENTS service binding entirely.</p></div>
</div>

<div id="GAP-292" style="margin:40px 0 0;padding:28px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--brd);">
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:6px;">
    <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--or);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;background:#E8692A18;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap;">GAP-292</span>
    <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#EF4444;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;background:#EF444418;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap;">CRITICAL</span>
