  <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The provisionSpace() listing in §62 has three fatal errors in the first 15 lines:

(1) spaceDO is declared twice in the same function:
  const spaceDO = getProductDO(rootSpaceId, env);   // line 1
  ... (several lines later) ...
  const spaceDO = env.NAELAO_SPACE_DO.get(...);     // line 2 — TypeScript compile error: cannot redeclare

