(3) getProductDO(rootSpaceId, env) references rootSpaceId which is not a parameter of provisionSpace() and is not defined anywhere in scope. This is a NameError at runtime.

These three bugs together mean the provisioner — the most critical lifecycle function in the entire Space Type system — will fail to compile and cannot run.</p></div>
