  <div class="box box-gr"><div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Use Workers for Platforms correctly: upload the portal script at provisioning time (not at request time) and dispatch by script name at request time.

// During provisionExternalPortal() — upload script to WfP dispatch namespace:
await fetch(
  `https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/accounts/${env.CF_ACCOUNT_ID}/workers/dispatch/namespaces/naelao-portals/scripts/portal-${spaceId}`,
  {
    method: 'PUT',
    headers: { 'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + env.CF_API_TOKEN,
                'Content-Type': 'application/javascript' },
    body: compiledPortalScript  // pre-compiled at provisioning time, not runtime
