// During request time in naelao-portal Worker — dispatch by name, no code string:
const userWorker = env.NAELAO_DISPATCH_NS.get('portal-' + spaceId);
return userWorker.fetch(request);  // forwards request to pre-uploaded script

Store portal-slug→spaceId in KV only for routing; never load or execute code strings at request time.</p></div>
