  <h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:clamp(16px,2.5vw,22px);font-weight:600;color:var(--tx);margin:0 0 16px;">void agentDO.fetch() Without ctx.waitUntil() — Foreground Agent Runs Killed When HTTP Response Returns</h3>
  <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The §28 naelao-threads Worker uses fire-and-forget to dispatch foreground agent runs:

// Step 5b: foreground mode
void agentDO.fetch('http://agent/run', { method: 'POST', body: JSON.stringify({...}) });
