  <h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:clamp(16px,2.5vw,22px);font-weight:600;color:var(--tx);margin:0 0 16px;">NAELAO_BILLING.recordTokens() Called as a DO RPC Method — naelao-billing Is a Standard Worker, Service Bindings Expose Only .fetch()</h3>
