  <h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:clamp(16px,2.5vw,22px);font-weight:600;color:var(--tx);margin:0 0 16px;">LoRA Fine-Tuning Loads Entire Training File into Memory via trainingObj.text() — OOM Crash for Datasets Over ~43 MB</h3>
