  <h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:clamp(16px,2.5vw,22px);font-weight:600;color:var(--tx);margin:0 0 16px;">Sweeper Reads DLQ via CF REST API with Account-Level Token — Security Anti-Pattern; DLQ Should Use Consumer Binding</h3>
  <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The sweeper's sweepDeadLetterQueue task calls:
  fetch('https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/accounts/${env.NAELAO_ACCOUNT_ID}/queues/naelao-dlq/messages', {
    headers: { Authorization: 'Bearer ' + env.CF_API_TOKEN }
