  <div class="box box-gr"><div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Declare naelao-dlq as a second Queue consumer binding in wrangler.jsonc for the sweeper Worker:
  [[queues.consumers]]
  queue = "naelao-dlq"
  binding = "NAELAO_DLQ"
  max_retries = 0  # DLQ — no further retries

