  <div class="box box-gr"><div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Use the Web platform API instead:
  function uint8ArrayToBase64(bytes: Uint8Array): string {
    let binary = '';
    for (let i = 0; i &lt; bytes.length; i++) {
      binary += String.fromCharCode(bytes[i]);
    }
    return btoa(binary);
  }
  const base64 = uint8ArrayToBase64(new Uint8Array(screenshot));

For large screenshots (&gt;1 MB), process in 8192-byte chunks to avoid stack overflow from String.fromCharCode spread: chunk the Uint8Array and concatenate the results before calling btoa().</p></div>
