  <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">After hibernation the container is destroyed and must be remounted, yet SQLite still records `r2_mounted='true'`. On the next wake, `ensureRunning` reads the persisted flag and skips `mountBucket`, so the freshly started container runs with no `/workspace` mounted. All file operations then silently hit an empty filesystem — reads return nothing, writes go to ephemeral container-local storage and vanish.</p></div>
