      <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#F97316;background:#F9731618;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;letter-spacing:.08em;">HIGH</span>
      <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#64748B;letter-spacing:.06em;">§ai-gateway — createTogetherAIClient() in shared/ai-client.ts</span>
    </div>
    <h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hd);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 18px;">createTogetherAIClient() Instantiates Anthropic SDK Against OpenAI-Compatible Together AI — 422 on All Calls</h3>
    <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">new Anthropic({ baseURL: 'https://app.naelao.dev/api/together-ai/v1', ... }) sends requests in Anthropic wire format (top-level system, max_tokens, Anthropic-specific headers). Together AI's API is OpenAI-compatible, not Anthropic-compatible. Every Together AI model call — fine-tune polling, AutoResearch, vision tasks — receives 422 Unprocessable Entity due to the format mismatch.</p></div>
    <div class="box box-gr"><div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Use the OpenAI SDK to call Together AI: new OpenAI({ baseURL: 'https://api.together.xyz/v1', apiKey: env.TOGETHER_AI_API_KEY }). All Together AI endpoints expect { model, messages, max_tokens, temperature } in OpenAI format, not Anthropic format. Alternatively, call fetch() directly with OpenAI-format JSON bodies and a Bearer token. Update the shared factory to switch SDK based on provider.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div id="G-P25" style="margin:40px 0 0;padding:28px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--brd);">
