    <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">In shared agent mode, the spec uses the same R2 path structure as per-user mode: spaces/{spaceId}/assistants/{userId}/skills/. However, because the DO is shared, skill writes from any user go through the same AssistantDO instance. If the path is constructed incorrectly (missing userId segment due to a bug), one user's personal skill write can overwrite another user's skill at the same path. The Moltworker reference uses divergent R2 paths for shared vs. per-user mode to make path collisions structurally impossible.</p></div>
