    <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The structured_facts table in AssistantDO SQLite has a decay_rate column (a float between 0 and 1, intended to represent how quickly a fact becomes less relevant over time). The spec never applies this decay rate in any query. Retrieval queries return all matching structured facts regardless of age, and no background job reduces the relevance score based on elapsed time and decay_rate. Over time, the structured_facts table accumulates stale facts (old addresses, outdated preferences, resolved issues) that degrade the quality of the agent's context injection.</p></div>
    <div class="box box-gr"><div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Apply decay in retrieval scoring and implement periodic cleanup:
```typescript
// Decayed relevance score at retrieval time
async getStructuredFacts(
  userId: string, category?: string
): Promise&lt;StructuredFact[]&gt; {
  return this.sql&lt;StructuredFact[]&gt;`
    SELECT *,
      -- Exponential decay: score * exp(-decay_rate * days_old)
      confidence * EXP(
        -decay_rate *
        (unixepoch('now') - updated_at/1000) / 86400.0
      ) AS effective_score
    FROM structured_facts
    WHERE user_id = ${userId}
      AND (${category ?? null} IS NULL OR category = ${category ?? null})
      AND confidence * EXP(
        -decay_rate *
        (unixepoch('now') - updated_at/1000) / 86400.0
      ) &gt; 0.1 -- prune near-zero relevance
    ORDER BY effective_score DESC
    LIMIT 50
  `;
}

// Weekly cleanup job: delete fully decayed facts
async pruneDecayedFacts() {
  await this.sql`
    DELETE FROM structured_facts
    WHERE confidence * EXP(
      -decay_rate * (unixepoch('now') - updated_at/1000) / 86400.0
    ) &lt; 0.05
  `;
}
```
Schedule pruneDecayedFacts() via this.scheduleEvery(604800, 'pruneDecayedFacts', {}).</p></div>
