<h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hd);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 18px;">Rate limiting described as KV-based in prose — KV eventual consistency makes it ineffective</h3>
