<p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The bootstrap annotation acceptance flow does not verify that the bootstrap WalletDO has sufficient balance before accepting a new annotation submission. When the fund reaches zero, `payAnnotator()` throws an error, but the annotation has already been added to the `annotations` table with `status = "accepted"`. The annotator receives an error but has already done the work. The annotation sits in a broken state: accepted but unpaid. Subsequent attempts by the same annotator fail with confusing errors. Space admins have no alert that the campaign paused due to insufficient funds.</p></div>
