<h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hd);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 18px;">Ingestion is not idempotent — re-uploading the same document creates a duplicate vector set</h3>
