<span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#F97316;background:#F9731618;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;letter-spacing:.08em;">HIGH</span>
<span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#64748B;letter-spacing:.06em;">§Email — Outbound — naelao-notifications / send rate cap</span>
</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hd);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 18px;">No per-space outbound email rate cap — a buggy or malicious agent can send 100k emails/hour</h3>
<div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div>
<p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Outbound email is dispatched via the Resend API from the notifications queue with no per-space rate limit. A buggy agent loop, a misconfigured campaign, or a malicious script can enqueue tens of thousands of emails, which Resend dispatches until the account-level limit trips — getting the entire platform's sending domain flagged or suspended, affecting all tenants.</p></div>
<div class="box box-gr"><div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div>
<p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Enforce a per-space outbound quota before dispatch, backed by a Durable Object counter:
```typescript
async function sendEmail(spaceId: string, email: Email, env: Env) {
  const limiterId = env.EMAIL_RATE_DO.idFromName(`email:${spaceId}`);
  const limiter = env.EMAIL_RATE_DO.get(limiterId);
  const { allowed, remaining } = await limiter.consume(1, { perHour: 500, perDay: 2000 });
  if (!allowed) {
    await deadLetter(email, "space_email_quota_exceeded");
    await alertSpaceAdmin(spaceId, "email quota reached");
    return;
  }
  await resendSend(email, env);
}
```
Tie the per-space limits to the space tier.</p></div>
</div>
<div id="G-W20" style="margin:40px 0 0;padding:28px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--brd);">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:6px;">
<span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--or);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;">G-W20</span>
<span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#F97316;background:#F9731618;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;letter-spacing:.08em;">HIGH</span>
<span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#64748B;letter-spacing:.06em;">§Multimodal — Images — agent / image input bounds</span>
