<h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hd);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 18px;">Concurrent setState() writes are last-write-wins — parallel tool results silently lose state mutations</h3>
<div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div>
<p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">When two operations in the same turn (e.g., two parallel tool results) both call `setState()` / write the synced state row, the second write overwrites the first with no conflict detection or merge. There is no version field, no optimistic-locking check, and no merge semantics. Observed-in-parallel scenarios (the same run watched from multiple tabs, or genuinely concurrent tool completions) silently lose mutations, leaving client and server state diverged.</p></div>
<div class="box box-gr"><div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div>
<p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Use optimistic concurrency with a version column and merge-or-retry:
```typescript
async function updateState(mutator: (s: State) =&gt; State) {
  for (let attempt = 0; attempt &lt; 5; attempt++) {
    const row = [...sql.exec("SELECT data, version FROM agent_state WHERE id=?", id)][0];
    const next = mutator(JSON.parse(row.data));
    const res = sql.exec(
      "UPDATE agent_state SET data=?, version=version+1 WHERE id=? AND version=?",
      JSON.stringify(next), id, row.version
    );
    if (res.rowsWritten === 1) return next;   // committed
    // else: someone else wrote — reload and retry
  }
  throw new Error("state update contention");
}
```
For commutative updates (appending messages), prefer append-only tables over whole-object setState.</p></div>
</div>
<div id="G-W26" style="margin:40px 0 0;padding:28px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--brd);">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:6px;">
<span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--or);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;">G-W26</span>
<span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#F97316;background:#F9731618;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;letter-spacing:.08em;">HIGH</span>
<span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#64748B;letter-spacing:.06em;">§Orchestration — State — NaelaoAgentDO / state sync payload</span>
