<div id="G-AX25" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
  <div class="box-rd" style="background:#fff3cd;border-left:4px solid #e67e22;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:.5rem;">
    <strong>G-AX25 [HIGH] — Builder Account Lockout and Brute Force Protection</strong><br>
    <em>The Gap:</em> Builder login has no protection against brute force password attacks. An attacker can attempt unlimited password guesses without account lockout or progressive delays. Account enumeration is possible via different error messages for "email not found" vs "wrong password."
