  <div class="box-gr" style="background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #2e7d32;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;">
    <em>Required Fix:</em> Implement LoginProtectionDO: track failed_attempts per email per 15-minute window in KV. Progressive lockout: after 5 failures → 15-minute lockout; after 10 failures → 1-hour lockout; after 20 failures → account locked (email unlock required). All lockout events logged. Uniform error messages: "Invalid email or password" (never distinguish). CAPTCHA on 3rd failed attempt (hCaptcha — CF-native). IP-based rate limit: max 50 login attempts per IP per hour. Notify builder via email on account lockout: "Your account was temporarily locked due to multiple failed login attempts." Track failed_login_attempts, account_lockout events in security audit log.
