  <div class="box-gr" style="background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #2e7d32;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;">
    <em>Required Fix:</em> Add magic_link to Space authentication options: builder enables in Space auth settings. On end-user login: POST /api/spaces/{id}/auth/magic-link with email → SpaceDO generates one-time token (32-byte random, 15-minute expiry), stores in SpaceDO SQLite magic_links table, sends email via AW30/AW32 template. End-user clicks link: GET /api/spaces/{id}/auth/magic-link?token={token} → validate token (check expiry, single-use), create session, redirect to Space. Token is one-time: invalidated immediately after use. Rate limit: max 3 magic link requests per email per hour (prevent email flooding). Track magic_link_sent, magic_link_used, magic_link_expired events.
