    <em>The Gap:</em> New builders often want to start from a complete, working Space rather than from scratch. Official "Clone and customize" templates for common business use cases (customer support, lead generation, employee assistant, document Q&amp;A, coding helper) would dramatically reduce time-to-first-value.
