</div>
<div id="G-AY47" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
  <div class="box-rd" style="background:#d4edda;border-left:4px solid #27ae60;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:.5rem;">
    <strong>G-AY47 [LOW] — End-User Avatar and Personalization Settings</strong><br>
    <em>The Gap:</em> End-users interacting with Spaces have no personal profile beyond session metadata. They cannot set a display name, avatar, or personal preferences that persist across sessions and are visible in collaborative sessions or multi-user scenarios.
