  </div>
  <div class="box-gr" style="background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #2e7d32;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;">
    <em>Required Fix:</em> Implement CCPA controls: "Do Not Sell My Personal Information" link in Space shell footer (for CA users detected by geo-header). Data inventory mapping: categorize all collected data fields per CCPA categories. Opt-out propagates to all downstream processors (analytics, LLM providers where possible). Annual privacy report for builders with large CA user bases. State privacy law matrix document maintained in legal KB.
  </div>
</div>
<div id="G-AZ36" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
