<div id="G-AZ42" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
  <div class="box-rd" style="background:#f8d7da;border-left:4px solid #c0392b;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:.5rem;">
    <strong>G-AZ42 [CRITICAL] — Input Content Moderation Pipeline</strong><br>
    <em>The Gap:</em> Users can send any content to Spaces including hate speech, CSAM descriptions, self-harm content, and jailbreak attempts. No input moderation pipeline screens messages before reaching the LLM or agent, creating legal liability and brand risk.
