  <div class="box-gr" style="background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #2e7d32;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;">
    <em>Required Fix:</em> Implement input moderation: before each LLM call, run message through CF Worker moderation pipeline: (1) LLM moderation API (Anthropic built-in or OpenAI Moderation), (2) regex-based jailbreak pattern detection, (3) PII detection for HIPAA Spaces. BLOCKED messages: return 400 with user-visible reason (e.g., "This message violates community guidelines"), log moderation_event with content_hash (not content), increment block_count. Builder can configure strictness: standard/strict/custom.
