  <div class="box-gr" style="background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #2e7d32;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;">
    <em>Required Fix:</em> Build user_trust_score (0-100): starts at 50. Increases: positive session outcomes, long engagement, repeat sessions. Decreases: moderation blocks, abuse reports, unusual patterns (rapid-fire requests, long inputs). Trust score gates: score &lt; 20 requires CAPTCHA, score &lt; 10 triggers shadow-ban (requests processed but responses hidden). Builder can see trust score distribution for their Space. Score resets after 90 days of positive behavior.
  </div>
</div>
<div id="G-AZ45" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
  <div class="box-rd" style="background:#fff3cd;border-left:4px solid #e67e22;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:.5rem;">
    <strong>G-AZ45 [HIGH] — Automated Abuse Report Processing</strong><br>
