  <div class="box-gr" style="background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #2e7d32;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;">
    <em>Required Fix:</em> Add "Report this response" button to Space shell. Report submits: {session_id, message_id, category, description}. Reports stored in abuse_reports table. Automated triage: if report_count for Space &gt; 5 in 24h, flag for human review. Reviewed reports: substantiated → builder warning → Space suspension. Unsubstantiated → dismiss. Publish Trust &amp; Safety transparency report quarterly. Maintain response SLA: &lt;48h acknowledgment.
  </div>
</div>
<div id="G-AZ46" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
  <div class="box-rd" style="background:#fff3cd;border-left:4px solid #e67e22;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:.5rem;">
    <strong>G-AZ46 [HIGH] — SpaceType SDK and CLI Tooling</strong><br>
