  <div class="box-gr" style="background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #2e7d32;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;">
    <em>Required Fix:</em> Publish @naelao/cli npm package: commands: naelao spacetype create, push, pull, diff, deploy, rollback. Auth via API key. SpaceType config represented as YAML file (spacetype.yaml) with full schema. naelao diff shows config diff before deploy. naelao deploy --env=prod applies config. GitHub Action: naelao/deploy-action@v1 for CI/CD. Track CLI adoption rate and most-used commands.
