  <div class="box-gr" style="background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #2e7d32;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;">
    <em>Required Fix:</em> Define local dev setup using Cloudflare Miniflare (v3): wrangler dev command runs Workers locally with DO, KV, R2, Queues emulation. Docker Compose: wrangler dev + local LLM proxy (LiteLLM) + local vector DB (Chroma). .env.local for API keys. Hot-reload on file save. Dev seed scripts: load sample SpaceTypes, create test user accounts, populate test KB. Document in Getting Started guide. CLI: naelao dev starts full local stack.
