  <div class="box-gr" style="background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #2e7d32;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;">
    <em>Required Fix:</em> Define API versioning policy: (1) Breaking changes require new API version (v1→v2), old version maintained 12 months, (2) Non-breaking additions are backward compatible, (3) Deprecated fields get Sunset response header (RFC 8594) with date, (4) 30/60/90-day warning emails before deprecation. Maintain public API changelog at /api/changelog. Builder dashboard shows "APIs you use that are deprecated" warning card.
  </div>
</div>
<div id="G-AZ49" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
  <div class="box-rd" style="background:#fff3cd;border-left:4px solid #e67e22;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:.5rem;">
    <strong>G-AZ49 [HIGH] — Integration Test Suite for Platform APIs</strong><br>
    <em>The Gap:</em> No integration test suite validates that platform APIs behave correctly across the full request lifecycle (auth → routing → DO dispatch → LLM → response). Unit tests cannot catch cross-component regressions.
