    <em>The Gap:</em> No runbook library covers the operational procedures for common failure scenarios: DO storage full, LLM provider outage, billing system failure, security incident, data loss event. Ops team must improvise under pressure during incidents.
  </div>
  <div class="box-gr" style="background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #2e7d32;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;">
