  <div class="box-gr" style="background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #2e7d32;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;">
    <em>Required Fix:</em> Schedule automated pentest pipeline: quarterly DAST scan using OWASP ZAP against staging environment covering all API endpoints. Monthly automated: nuclei templates scan for known CVEs on all exposed endpoints. Continuous: fuzzing of API inputs using RestTestGen or RESTler in pre-prod environment. Results: severity-triaged report, CRITICAL findings block next deploy, HIGH findings require fix within 30 days. Track vulnerability_backlog_age.
  </div>
</div>
<div id="G-BA31" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
  <div class="box-rd" style="background:#fff3cd;border-left:4px solid #e67e22;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:.5rem;">
    <strong>G-BA31 [HIGH] — Plugin / Extension System for Platform Features</strong><br>
