<div id="G-BA42" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
  <div class="box-rd" style="background:#fff3cd;border-left:4px solid #e67e22;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:.5rem;">
    <strong>G-BA42 [HIGH] — WebSocket Connection Rate Limiting and Authentication</strong><br>
    <em>The Gap:</em> WebSocket connections (agent streaming, live presence, collaborative editing) are established without rate limiting or per-connection authentication re-validation. An attacker can exhaust DO WebSocket connection capacity (CF limit: 1M connections per DO) via connection flooding.
