    <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--or);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;">G-I15</span>
    <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#EAB308;background:#EAB30818;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;letter-spacing:.08em;">MEDIUM</span>
    <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#64748B;letter-spacing:.06em;">§Integration — portal — auth</span>
  </div>
  <h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hd);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 18px;">Portal Does Not Pass Builder Auth Context to Space — End-User Cannot Be Pre-Authenticated</h3>
  <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">When a builder embeds a Space in their website, end-users are always anonymous. There is no mechanism to pass the builder's own auth context (e.g. a signed user token from the builder's auth system) to the Space session.</p></div>
  <div class="box box-gr"><div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Implement trusted token pass-through: the Space can be configured with a `trusted_issuer_jwks_url`. The portal accepts an `end_user_token` query parameter (JWT from the builder's auth system). The SpaceDO validates the JWT against the trusted issuer's JWKS and uses the `sub` claim as the `end_user_id`. This enables seamless identity federation without builders writing any server-side code.</p></div>
</div>

<div id="G-I16" style="margin:40px 0 0;padding:28px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--brd);">
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:6px;">
    <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--or);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;">G-I16</span>
    <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#F97316;background:#F9731618;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;letter-spacing:.08em;">HIGH</span>
    <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#64748B;letter-spacing:.06em;">§Integration — analytics — billing</span>
