  <h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hd);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 18px;">Usage Events Not Linked to Billing Events — Cannot Reconcile Token Usage Against Invoice</h3>
  <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Token usage events in Analytics Engine and billing events in Stripe are separate records with no shared key. An enterprise customer who disputes their invoice cannot be shown the exact usage breakdown that generated the charge.</p></div>
  <div class="box box-gr"><div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Add `billing_period_id` to all usage analytics events. When Stripe generates an invoice, include the `billing_period_id` in the invoice metadata. The billing worker can then query Analytics Engine `WHERE billing_period_id = '{id}'` to produce a line-item usage report. Expose `GET /v1/billing/usage/{invoiceId}/breakdown` that returns token usage by Space and day.</p></div>
</div>

<div id="G-I17" style="margin:40px 0 0;padding:28px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--brd);">
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:6px;">
    <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--or);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;">G-I17</span>
    <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#F97316;background:#F9731618;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;letter-spacing:.08em;">HIGH</span>
    <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#64748B;letter-spacing:.06em;">§Integration — mcp-hub — tools</span>
