  <h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hd);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 18px;">SpaceDO Schema Migration Does Not Handle Pre-Existing Data — Old Sessions Lose Metadata</h3>
  <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The SpaceDO v2 migration adds FTS5 tables and triggers. These triggers only fire on new INSERTs after migration. Existing messages in the `messages` table are not backfilled into the FTS5 index, so full-text search returns no results for historical conversations.</p></div>
  <div class="box box-gr"><div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Add a backfill step to the v2 migration: after creating the FTS5 table, run `INSERT INTO messages_fts(rowid, content) SELECT rowid, content FROM messages`. This may be slow for DOs with large message histories — break it into batches of 1000 rows with `LIMIT/OFFSET`. Track backfill progress in the `_meta` table.</p></div>
</div>

<div id="G-I19" style="margin:40px 0 0;padding:28px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--brd);">
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:6px;">
