  <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Critical platform events (new login, quota warning, billing failure, KB indexing complete) have no notification delivery mechanism. The billing worker references sending emails but there is no notifications worker or transactional email integration.</p></div>
  <div class="box box-gr"><div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Implement the notifications worker: it consumes from `naelao-notifications-queue`. Supported channels: email (via Resend API), in-app notification (stored in D1, polled by dashboard), webhook (HTTP POST to configured URL). Notification templates are stored in D1 per event type. Support per-user notification preferences: `notification_preferences (user_id, channel, event_type, enabled)`.</p></div>
</div>

<div id="G-I20" style="margin:40px 0 0;padding:28px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--brd);">
