  <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The billing architecture uses Stripe for platform billing but does not implement Stripe Connect for marketplace monetization. Builders who want to charge end-users for access to their Spaces cannot do so through the platform.</p></div>
  <div class="box box-gr"><div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Implement Stripe Connect: onboard builders who want to monetize via `POST /v1/billing/connect/onboard`. Use Stripe Connect Express accounts. When an end-user upgrades to access a paid Space, the platform collects payment and routes the builder's share (minus platform fee) to the builder's Stripe Connect account. Track revenue splits in D1.</p></div>
</div>

