  <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The architecture includes a `search` worker for cross-Space content discovery (e.g. 'find me all Spaces related to customer support'). Without it, builders cannot discover relevant SpaceTypes in the marketplace, and end-users cannot search across their accessible Spaces.</p></div>
  <div class="box box-gr"><div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Implement the search worker: it indexes SpaceType titles, descriptions, and tags in a Vectorize index with `type: 'space_type'` metadata. Supports semantic search (`POST /v1/search/space-types?q=customer+support`). Powered by the same hybrid retrieval (Vectorize + BM25) as the KB search. Expose the search API in the marketplace web app for Space discovery.</p></div>
