  <h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hd);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 18px;">Portal Loads SpaceType Config on Every Request — No Caching Causes Repeated D1 Reads</h3>
  <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The portal (end-user chat) loads the full SpaceType manifest from D1 on every session creation. With 10,000 concurrent sessions, this is 10,000 D1 reads per minute for potentially the same SpaceType.</p></div>
  <div class="box box-gr"><div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Cache SpaceType manifests in KV: on first load, write `space_type:{id}:manifest` to KV with TTL 300s. Subsequent loads read from KV. Invalidate the cache key when the SpaceType manifest is updated. For the most popular SpaceTypes (used by thousands of Spaces), use CF Smart Placement to ensure the worker runs close to the KV PoP.</p></div>
</div>

<div id="G-I25" style="margin:40px 0 0;padding:28px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--brd);">
