  <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The architecture includes an `admin` worker for platform administration (tenant management, support tools, billing overrides, feature flag control). Without it, all admin operations require direct D1 SQL queries via wrangler or the CF dashboard.</p></div>
  <div class="box box-gr"><div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Implement the admin worker: protected by a separate admin JWT with `role: 'platform_admin'` scope. Endpoints: `GET /admin/tenants`, `POST /admin/tenants/{id}/suspend`, `GET /admin/feature-flags`, `PUT /admin/feature-flags/{key}`, `POST /admin/users/{id}/impersonate` (links to G-B49), `GET /admin/usage-report`. All admin actions are written to a separate admin audit log.</p></div>
