  <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The architecture includes an `apps-registry` worker for managing installable apps (think Slack App Directory but for Naelao Spaces). Without it, every integration must be hard-coded into the platform.</p></div>
