  <div class="box box-rd"><div class="box-lbl">The Gap</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The architecture includes a `sweeper` worker for cleaning up orphaned resources: sessions that never received a message, vectors for deleted documents, R2 files for deleted Spaces, and stale DO state for abandoned agent runs.</p></div>
  <div class="box box-gr"><div class="box-lbl">Required Fix</div><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Implement the sweeper worker as a CF Cron Trigger (daily): scan D1 for sessions older than 90 days with no messages, delete them and their DO state. Scan for KB documents in `failed` status for more than 7 days, delete their vectors from Vectorize. Scan for R2 objects without corresponding D1 records, delete them. Run each sweep in a CF Workflow to handle timeouts gracefully.</p></div>
</div>

<div id="G-I28" style="margin:40px 0 0;padding:28px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--brd);">
